\subsubsection{Operational Deployment Outcomes}
The development deployment recorded 7 successful registrations and 4 successful logins among the 25 logged attempts. The remaining login outcomes comprised 7 \texttt{NO\_ENROLLMENT} records, 6 \texttt{CAPTCHA\_MISMATCH} records, and 1 \texttt{SPEECH\_NOT\_RECOGNIZED} record. These are workflow observations rather than biometric error rates; no logged failure was a biometric mismatch, so no FAR or FRR is inferred from them.

\subsubsection{Voice Threshold Derivation}
